* If with a short statement

Like ⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000001⟫for⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000002⟫, the ⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000003⟫if⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000004⟫ statement can start with a short statement to execute before the condition.

Variables declared by the statement are only in scope until the end of the ⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000005⟫if⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000006⟫.

(Try using ⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000007⟫v⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000008⟫ in the last ⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000009⟫return⟪GTI18N_02e31026_000010⟫ statement.)

